==Slateport City/Lilycove City==
===Harbor===
Fly back to either [[Slateport City]] or [[Lilycove City]], then visit the harbor building. Speak to the attendant to present your ticket, and she asks where you would like to go. The ferry also travels between the two cities, but it's time to set sail for the {{gdis|Battle Tower|III}}!

